  "issue32": {
    "body": "## Goal\nEstablish explicit material nucleation separately from ordinary SDF boundary motion.\n\n## Dependencies\n- P23-01 topology policy registered.\n- GEOM-01 compatible topology/geometry gates.\n- Birth-1 requires a qualified primal; production gradient is not required for the first finite proposal scan.\n\n## Birth-0\nGeometry-only deterministic known-seed fixture:\n- create exactly the intended new component,\n- obey forbidden/root/clearance/min-feature policy,\n- classify component-count change correctly,\n- reject deliberately invalid seeds.\n\n## Birth-1\n- Generate a finite preregistered seed set.\n- Evaluate candidates with actual primal responses.\n- Accept only a seed that satisfies the policy/hard gates and produces registered improvement; otherwise rollback.\n\n## Done\nTopology birth is demonstrably intentional, policy-compliant and primal-confirmed.\n\n## Non-goal\nDo not claim a production topological-derivative method. Stage T density/Brinkman may be evaluated later as a proposer, not assumed.\n\n## GitHub dependencies\n- Depends on #29\n- Depends on #31",
